          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "智能注水调配业务背景",
          "html": "<p>分层注水分配需要在有限水量与不同层段吸水能力之间权衡。已经高含水的优势通道继续增注，未必产生最大的增油响应。本例以三层边际递减的响应代理，在总量和层上限约束下分配小步水量，展示层间调整对整体目标的影响。</p><figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"分层配注量，窄屏横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"分层配注量\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:620px;max-width:860px;margin:auto\"><title>分层配注量</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M75 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-12.8</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M75 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">33.6</text><text x=\"222.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><path d=\"M75 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M75 103.75H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">126.4</text><text x=\"517.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><path d=\"M75 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">172.8</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#267d70\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"75,145.9159482758621 370,140.12392241379314 665,116.95581896551727\"/><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"145.9159482758621\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"140.12392241379314\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"116.95581896551727\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b5692b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"75,134.33189655172416 370,134.33189655172416 665,134.33189655172416\"/><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"134.33189655172416\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7659a8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"75,111.16379310344828 370,64.82758620689657 665,87.99568965517244\"/><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"111.16379310344828\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"64.82758620689657\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"87.99568965517244\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">层号</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"156\" transform=\"rotate(-90 20 156)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">注水 / m³/d</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>分层配注与上限比较标出受限层；凹响应曲线显示继续增注的边际价值逐渐降低，因此最优不等于平均分配。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</figcaption><p>优化 · 等配 · 吸水上限；横轴：层号；纵轴：注水 / m³/d。</p></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "METHOD",
          "title": "分层注水边际收益调配计算方法",
          "html": "<p>为三层定义吸水上限、含水编码和递减收益代理。；总量以5m³/d离散，预算不足、容量用满或最大边际收益不为正则停止。；每步选增配后目标增量最大的未满层，仅正收益时分配。；输出各层配注、未分配量与等配目标，同时展示上限。</p><p>三层无交叉耦合的凹注采响应代理；等配可能违反层吸水上限，单独展示。未模拟真实连通系数、压裂压力、滞后与地层压力；不得作为配注指令。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "LIMITS",
          "title": "评价边界与专业资料",
          "html": "<p>目标=Σ[增益×(1−含水)×70×(1−exp(−q/70))−0.0005q²]；在总量不超过预算、同一分层凹函数和等步长下，正边际贪心分配是离散最优；允许保留水量。</p><p>未模拟层间串流、注采滞后、压力或破裂；等配基线可能越过单层上限，不能当现场可行方案。所有收益是教学代理。</p><p>全部数据、系数、参数范围和阈值均为教学假设，不代表现场效果。</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/case-study-with-navigation/di/enhancing-waterflooding-efficiency-through-integrated-workflows-and-advanced-analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SLB：注水监控与分析</a>：支持注采连通、配注与短期情景优化的业务背景；未复制其CRM模型或收益。</li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
